        {
            "_id": "ETLi2wu5takbCTEd",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Mind's Cry",
            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>15 feet. A boom of phantom wings and bugle of despondent mental calls constantly surrounds the mournful sardus endling, making telepathic communication uncomfortable. A creature with any form of telepathy or hive mind who enters or begins its turn in the emanation must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:25] save or become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure) and can't reduce its sickened value while inside the emanation. A creature that critically succeeds at its save is immune to mind's cry for 24 hours.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "key": "Aura",
                        "radius": 15
                    }
                ],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "aura",
                        "divine",
                        "mental"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "vSiVs8qda0rwjNxL",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Rejuvenation",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When a sardus endling is destroyed, it reforms after [[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the area where it first emerged, fully healed. A sardus endling can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting, such as through an act of decolonization, ecological restoration, or curing the disease responsible for its extinction.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
