        {
            "_id": "2BNkMXgX2cSWWV45",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Trumpet Cry",
            "sort": 900000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The sardus endling unleashes a haunting warbling cry that freezes its prey. All non-endling creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> No effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Paralyzed] until the beginning of the sardus endling's next turn.</p>"
                },
