            "level": {
                "value": 8
            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Sarduses once stalked the rivers and marshes of Krethiskar, using their long legs to wade into swift streams and their sharp beaks to spear fish and large amphibians. Due to their size, they had few predators on their home world until the arrival of the Swarm. Like everything else on Krethiskar, the sarduses were devoured as their planet became a huskworld. Now, while the impressive span of their ghostly wings no longer blots out the sun, the wrath-filled trumpets of these vengeful spirits still echo across the planet's deserted waterways.</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Secrets of the Swarm Adventure Path"
            }
        },
